{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23003","headline":"除忠州寄谢崔相公 · 白居易","name":"除忠州寄谢崔相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"提拔出泥知力竭，吹嘘生翅见情深。\n劒锋缺折难冲斗，桐尾烧焦岂望琴。\n感旧两行年老泪，酬恩一寸岁寒心。\n忠州好恶何须问，鸟得辞笼不择林。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23003.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23003","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}